        "id": "chk_doc_9388_2",
        "documentId": "doc_93885f20c9aff7b3",
        "chunkIndex": 2,
        "text": "PSDA:\n• Applications of Numerical Methods in various domains\n• Numerical problems on Interpolation\n• Numerical problems on Numerical Integration and Differentiation, Ordinary Differential Equations\n• Numerical problems on solution of algebraic and transcendental equations\n• Numerical problems on solution of system of linear equations\nPedagogy for Course Delivery:\n• Lectures,\n• Assignments,\n• Presentations,\n• Online / Practical Test and\n• Class Test\n• Blended Learning using flipped mode\nLab/ Practical’s details, if applicable:\nList of Experiments:\n1. Implementation of Newton’s forward interpolation formula\n2. Implementation of Newton’s backward interpolation formula\n3. Implementation of Lagrange’s interpolation formula\n4. Implementation of Trapezoidal rule\n5. Implementation of Simpson’s 1/3 rule\n6. Implementation of Simpson’s 3/8 rule\n7. Implementation of Weddle’s rule\n8. Implementation of Simpson’s 1/3 rule\n9. Implementation of Bisection method\n10. Implementation of Newton-Raphson method\n11. Implementation of Regula Falsi Method\n12. Implementation of Gauss Seidel Method\n13. Implementation of Gauss Elimination Method\n14. Implementation of Euler method\n15. Implementation of Runge Kutta Method",
